PRIVACY POLICY – CAL HERO
Last Updated: February 15, 2026
Cal Hero (“Cal Hero”, “we”, “our”, or “us”) is a calorie tracking application designed to help users log foods and view nutritional information.
Cal Hero works without account registration or login.
We respect your privacy and minimize data collection whenever possible.
By using the app, you agree to this Privacy Policy.
1. NO ACCOUNT OR LOGIN
Cal Hero does not require user registration.
We do NOT collect:
Name
Email address
Phone number
Contacts
Passwords
Social media accounts
You can use the app completely anonymously.
2. INFORMATION YOU PROVIDE
The app processes only the information you actively enter:
Food names you search
Barcodes you type
Nutrition values you manually enter
Food photos you scan
Text you submit to AI features
You control what you provide and when.
3. PERMISSIONS USED
Camera
Used only when you choose to scan food.
The camera is never accessed in the background.
Photos (optional)
If you select an image manually, the app accesses only the selected image.
The app never scans your photo library automatically.
4. LOCAL DATA STORAGE
Your logs and preferences are stored locally on your device.
We do not require cloud accounts and we do not upload your food diary to our servers.
If you uninstall the app, the operating system may delete the local data permanently.
5. THIRD-PARTY DATA SHARING (REQUIRED FOR FEATURES)
Some features require sending user-provided content to external services to function.
This occurs ONLY when you use features such as:
Food search
Barcode lookup
AI food analysis
What Data May Be Sent
Depending on the feature:
Food search text
Barcode numbers
Food images you scan
Technical request metadata (device type, app version, language)
What Is NOT Sent
We never send:
Name
Email
Contacts
Photo library
Location
Any data without your action
6. ARTIFICIAL INTELLIGENCE PROCESSING
Cal Hero includes AI-powered food recognition features.
When you use AI features, the content you submit (such as a food image or text description) is transmitted to a third-party AI provider for analysis.
AI Provider
Replace with your provider:
OpenAI, L.L.C.
(or insert your real provider name)
Purpose of Processing
The data is used only to:
Identify food
Estimate calories
Generate nutrition results
The data is NOT used to identify you.
We do NOT sell your data.
7. USER PERMISSION BEFORE AI PROCESSING
Before any data is sent to the AI provider, the app displays a permission dialog explaining:
What data will be sent
Why it is sent
Who receives it
You must tap Allow before processing occurs.
If you choose Not Now, the feature will not send data.
You can stop using AI features at any time.
8. THIRD-PARTY PROTECTION STANDARDS
We require any AI or data provider used by the app to apply privacy and security protections equal to or greater than this policy.
Data is transmitted only to generate the requested result.
9. NO ADVERTISING / NO TRACKING
Cal Hero:
Does NOT contain ads
Does NOT use ad networks
Does NOT track users across apps
Does NOT sell personal data
No advertising identifiers are used.
10. NO ANALYTICS TRACKING
Cal Hero does not use analytics tracking tools that profile users.
Crash or performance logs may be generated by the operating system only for stability purposes and do not identify users.
11. DATA RETENTION
We retain data only as long as necessary:
Local logs remain on your device
AI requests are processed only to generate a response
We do not maintain user profiles
12. SECURITY
We use reasonable safeguards to protect transmitted data.
However, no transmission method is 100% secure.
13. CHANGES TO THIS POLICY
We may update this policy periodically.
Changes will appear with an updated “Last Updated” date.
Continued use of the app means you accept the changes.
